Step-1: Understanding Problem Statement
Publisher and Subscriber System => Design a message broker where publishers publish messages to topics and subscribers subscribe to topics. Every subscriber of a topic receives every message in order, and tracks its own read position (offset).

Step-2: Requirement Gathering
1. Publisher can send message
2. Subscriber can read message.
3. Subscriber and Publisher have indirectly many-to-many relation.
4. Publisher and Subscriber will be loosely coupled.
5. Subscriber can subscribe/unsubscribe to a Topic through the Broker; publishers stay unaware of subscribers.
6. Message read by Subscriber is near real-time.

