Step-4: Class Diagram + Relationship b/w Entities + Design Patterns

****Class-Diagram****

class Topic {
	-String id
	-String name
	-List<Message> messages
	-long latestOffset = -1
}

class Broker {
	-String id
	-String name
	-Map<String, Map<String, Subscription>> subscriptions; // topicId -> subscriberId -> Subscription
	-Map<String, Set<Publisher>> topicPublisher //key = topic_id, Topic Wise Publisher
	-Map<String, Topic> topics
}

class Publisher {
	-String id
	-String name
	-Broker broker
}

class Subscriber {
	-String id
	-String name
	-Broker broker
}

class Subscription {
	-Topic topic
	-Subscriber subscriber
	-long lastCommittedOffset = -1
}

class Message {
	-String id
	-String payload
	-Topic topic
	-long offset
}

****Relationship-b/w-Entities****
Topic - Broker = M:1
Subscription - Broker = M:1
Publisher - Broker = M:1
Subscriber - Broker = M:1
Message - Topic = M:1
Topic - Subscriber = M:M
Topic - Publisher = M:M
Subscription - Topic = M:1
Subscription - Subscriber = M:1

****Design-Patterns****
Observer Design Pattern and Facade Desing Pattern
Broker is the Facade and Observer subject
Subscriber is the Observer



Step-5: Schema Design + Attributes (PK + FK + attrib) + Cardinalities

****Cardinalities****
topic - broker = M:1
publisher - broker = M:1
subscriber - broker = M:1
message - topic = M:1
topic - subscriber = M:M
topic - publisher = M:M
topic_subscription - subscriber = M:1
topic_subscription - topic = M:1

****Schema Desgin + Attributes (PK + FK + attrib) ****

topic(	id String PK,
		String name,
		latestOffset long,
		broker_id String FK -> broker(id)
	)

broker(	id String PK,
		String name
		)

publisher(id String PK,
			String name,
			broker_id String  FK -> broker(id)
		)

subscriber(	id String PK,
			String name,
			broker_id String FK -> broker(id)
		)

message( id String PK,
		String payload,
		offset long,
		String topic_id FK -> topic(id)
	)

topic_publisher(	topic_id String FK -> topic(id),
					publisher_id String FK -> publisher(id),
					Primary key{ topic_id, publisher_id }
				)

topic_subscription(	topic_id String FK -> topic(id),
					subscriber_id String FK -> subscriber(id),
					last_committed_offset long,
					Primary Key{ topic_id, subscriber_id }
				)
